Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:27.79,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs42\fnTimes New Roman\b1}The Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad was\Nthe Fujiwara Clan's personal squad of assassins.\NWe lived in darkness and served with selfless devotion.\NWe were even forbidden from having our own names.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:31.88,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs42\fnTimes New Roman\b1}Yet that man once granted me a name.\NSo he could execute me instead\Nfor his crime of slaying his own kin.
